  "Description": "Allows users to control the false discovery rate (FDR) or\nfamilywise error rate (FWER) for online multiple hypothesis\ntesting, where hypotheses arrive in a stream. In this\nframework, a null hypothesis is rejected based on the evidence\nagainst it and on the previous rejection decisions.",
